'''Luger''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 1]] or through [[trading]].   

== Appearance ==
It resembles a metallic  yellowish color luger pistol, hence the name. However, the toggle pin and the grip of the handle are slightly darker in color.

== Trivia ==
* It was used to [[Crafting|craft]] the [[Red Luger]] and [[Green Luger]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015]], as well as the [[Ginger Luger]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Luger]], which can be found in the same box.
*This is currently the most reskinned [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun with a total of five different reskins. Those being the [[Ginger Luger]], [[Red Luger]], [[Green Luger]], [[Chroma Luger]], [[Lugercane]], and allegedly former reskin Black Luger (now [[Glitch2]]).
* It's model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/95354288/Luger-Pistol Luger Pistol], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux. However, it was retextured, altering it from a black shade to a golden color.
*It partners with the [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife [[Corrupt]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Corrupt Set|Corrupt Set]].
*Luger's texture was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/6497949/profile/ DarkGenex] back in 2013.
**The texture can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/126534866/Gold-Luger here].
*When salvaged, it provides 65 godly [[shards]].

